# Attempts Saver

Attempts Saver is a lightweight, browser‑based tool designed for Geometry Dash players who want a reliable way to record, review, and understand their attempts. It runs entirely on the client side, requires no installation, and keeps all data local to the user.

---

## Overview

Attempts Saver focuses on three principles:

- **Clarity** — a clean interface that stays out of the way  
- **Speed** — quick input actions for real‑time use  
- **Control** — your data stays on your device, with full export/import options  

The application is maintained under The Block Times LLC and developed by Axionyx Group.

---

## Web Version

**Live Application:**  
https://attempts-saver.netlify.app

The web version is the primary and most up‑to‑date release. It supports modern browsers (Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari) and receives updates instantly without requiring downloads.

